  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116504",
      "title": "Introducing Route-based Lazy Loading",
      "lectureOrder": 303,
      "videoOrder": 288,
      "sourceHash": "d3eda48ef7684304feac5bd286bc10b6d03a5a0976b2cf8fd92914cfeedf99c6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.08,
          "end": 5.55,
          "en": "Now Angular offers two main ways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.55,
          "end": 9.75,
          "en": "two main approaches you can use for adding lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.75,
          "end": 10.8,
          "en": "to your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.8,
          "end": 14.34,
          "en": "And these approaches are actually not alternatives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.34,
          "end": 15.9,
          "en": "to each other, but instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.9,
          "end": 17.94,
          "en": "you can use both approaches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.94,
          "end": 21.96,
          "en": "in one and the same application if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.96,
          "end": 24.36,
          "en": "You don't have to, but you can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.36,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "And the first approach is that you use routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 31.26,
          "en": "as a lazy loading mechanism.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 32.55,
          "en": "Take this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.55,
          "end": 37.55,
          "en": "which we built in this routing course section as an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 41.19,
          "en": "in there, we of course got a couple of routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.19,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "We got the main route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 46.77,
          "en": "We got the user tasks, routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.77,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "and we have some sub routes there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 51.48,
          "en": "specifically one for showing all tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 54.843,
          "en": "and one for showing this new task component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.98,
          "end": 59.97,
          "en": "And even though this is just a simple demo application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.97,
          "end": 63.93,
          "en": "we could of course consider only loading the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.93,
          "end": 66.99,
          "en": "that belongs to the tasks component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.99,
          "end": 70.983,
          "en": "and/or to the new task component when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.33,
          "end": 76.56,
          "en": "Because when I, as a website user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 79.41,
          "en": "visit this page for the first time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.41,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "and I end up on just the domain/nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.86,
          "end": 86.16,
          "en": "so I'm not on some path here on some nested route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 88.2,
          "en": "but I'm just on the main page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.2,
          "end": 92.85,
          "en": "If I do that, I of course can't see any tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.85,
          "end": 97.263,
          "en": "I also can't see this new task form component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 101.46000000000001,
          "en": "But at the moment, without lazy loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.46000000000001,
          "end": 104.52000000000001,
          "en": "all the code for the entire application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.52000000000001,
          "end": 106.38,
          "en": "and for all the components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.38,
          "end": 109.5,
          "en": "would already be loaded initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.5,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "So at the point of time where I load this website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 116.00999999999999,
          "en": "the entire compiled Angular code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.00999999999999,
          "end": 119.31,
          "en": "is downloaded from the hosting server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.31,
          "end": 122.43299999999999,
          "en": "and is then executed in my browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "Now of course, this is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 127.44,
          "en": "a very basic example application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.44,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "and there isn't too much code in this app anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.07,
          "end": 135.66,
          "en": "So not using lazy loading here is no big problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.66,
          "end": 140.13,
          "en": "We can absolutely build this app without lazy loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.13,
          "end": 143.16,
          "en": "but as mentioned, we could consider adding it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 145.07999999999998,
          "en": "and to practice this concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.07999999999998,
          "end": 147.75,
          "en": "of lazy loading based on routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.75,
          "end": 149.37,
          "en": "we'll do just that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 151.5,
          "en": "We'll build up on this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "and we'll add routing based lazy loading to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 156.81,
          "en": "Now, for that attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 160.32,
          "en": "you also find my latest snapshot of this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.32,
          "end": 163.47,
          "en": "so that we can all use the same starting point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 164.85,
          "en": "And in the next lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.85,
          "end": 167.793,
          "en": "we'll now add this route-based lazy loading.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
